 "Parses a XML string and infers its schema in DDL format.\n\n`xml`: a XML string.\n`options`: options to control how the xml is parsed. accepts the same options and the XML data source. See <a href= \"https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/sql-data-sources-xml.html#data-source-option\"> Data Source Option</a> in the version you use.",
